=Question from teammate {{ $json.user }} in Slack: "{{ $json.text }}"
Retrieved memory (may be empty): {{ JSON.stringify($json.retrieved) }}
{{ $json.memoryNote }}
Reply with ONLY this JSON, no other text: {"answer": "...", "confidence": 0.0, "sources": ["..."], "needsEscalation": false, "needsApproval": false, "reason": "..."}

